  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "The table lists 53 functional requirements (ANC.FXNREQ.001–053) for a digital antenatal care system, grouped by business process A (registration) and B (ANC contact). Each requirement is written as a user story giving the activity, the user role (“As a…”) and what that user wants the system to do.",
